# Licensing

This project has two parts with different terms.

## Map data — CC BY-SA 3.0 (not optional)

`data/territories.json` and `data/sea-routes.json` are derived from
[`Risk_board.svg`](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Risk_board.svg) by
**Gr0gmint**, published on Wikimedia Commons under
[CC BY-SA 3.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) (and, at the
author's option, the GFDL).

The territory outlines were extracted from that file and re-baked into JSON, which
makes them an adaptation. Under share-alike they stay CC BY-SA 3.0: you may copy,
distribute and modify them provided you keep this attribution and license any
derivative of them on the same terms.

`data/board.json` (adjacency, continent bonuses, names) is not derived from the SVG —
it's the standard Risk board topology, which is a fact rather than a creative work.

## Code

Everything under `src/`, `scripts/` and the project configuration is original work
and is **not** covered by the map's share-alike terms.

No license has been chosen for it yet, which under copyright means all rights are
reserved by default. If you want others to reuse it, add one (MIT and Apache-2.0 are
the usual choices for a project like this).

## Trademark

"RISK" is a trademark of Hasbro, and the commercial board's artwork is theirs. Game
rules are not copyrightable and no Hasbro artwork is used here, but the name and the
wordmark in the UI are not ours to publish under. Rename before distributing this as
anything other than a personal project.
